@startuml uc-018-pay-for-travel
title UC-018 Pay for Travel — UX task flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4CC
  DiamondBorderColor #8A6D1D
}

|ACT-001 Customer|
start
:MSS 1 — Choose to pay and\nidentify the Travel Order;

|System|
:MSS 2 — Retrieve confirmed context\nand check authorization;
:MSS 3 — Obtain and validate amount,\ncurrency, purpose, and payment information;
if (Context, authority, and\ninformation sufficient?) then (yes)
else (no — EXT 2-3)
  :Identify what is needed;
  :Preserve the last confirmed state;
  :Communicate the missing need\nwithout confirming payment;
  stop
endif

:MSS 4 — Perform Sales responsibilities\nand coordinate required responsibilities;
if (Payment outcome confirmed?) then (yes)
  :Apply the confirmed payment exactly once;
  :Make its effect visible;
else (no — EXT 4)
  :Record failed, partial, pending,\nor otherwise uncertain result;
  :Do not present payment as confirmed;
  :Make duplicate attempts detectable;
  :Offer retry, revision, or\nhuman-assistance path;
  stop
endif

|ACT-001 Customer|
:MSS 5 — Review or confirm the payment,\nbalance effect, and receipt information;
if (Result confirmed?) then (yes)
else (no — EXT 5)
  |System|
  :Preserve the confirmed baseline;
  :Return affected information\nfor revision;
  stop
endif

|System|
:MSS 6 — Record outcome, provenance,\nand unresolved next steps;
:Communicate what payment-dependent\nactivities may proceed;
stop

legend bottom
Textual UC-018 is authoritative.
MSS = main success scenario; EXT = extension.
endlegend
@enduml
